Atty. Alexander B. Cabrera: Yung isa po ay qualified opinion.

706
01:50:34,210 --> 01:51:02,650
Atty. Alexander B. Cabrera: Which means may problema po yung financial statements. Either meron pong hindi nakita yung auditor at yung hindi niya po nakita ay material. Or nakita niya po at may nakita po siyang discrepancy at yung nakita niya pong discrepancy ay material. Pero sa dalawa pong sitwasyon na to, yung kanya pong nakitang discrepancy o hindi niya nakitang document, material man, ay hindi po pervasive.

